# Tools the CI needs on top of the project's own dependencies.
# requirements/ci.txt pins these together with pyproject.toml's dependencies and
# the dev extra, with hashes. Regenerate it with the command in ci.txt's header.
pip-audit
build
uv
pip
hatchling
# setuptools ships preinstalled (and outdated) with the runner's Python;
# pinning it here upgrades it under hash checking so pip-audit passes.
setuptools
editables
